    - `security_rules`
    - `forbidden_changes`
    - `review_priority`
  - excluded:
    - repo-wide constitutional text
    - one-off hidden chain-of-thought requests
- expected_sections:
  - `Acknowledgment`
  - `Analysis`
  - `Execution`
  - `Impact & Risk`
  - `Verification`
- placeholder_map:
  - `{work_type_set}`
  - `{shared_constraints}`
  - `{shared_output_format}`
  - `{repo_commands}`
  - `{security_rules}`
  - `{forbidden_changes}`
  - `{review_priority}`
